<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/9/eng@/~cl_10__subsec_5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/9/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/9/eng@/~cl_10__subsec_5> <https://schema.org/text> "Any Government entity that achieves a rating as determined by the Chief Secretary to the Government may be considered to receive incentives and recognition from the Government."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/9/eng@> .
